WEBVTT

NOTE
End of Disc 1 cliffhanger — Edea conjures an ice shard and impales Squall.
Duration: approximately 50 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Blue magical energy gathers around Edea

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.400
Edea raises her hand and conjures an enormous shard of jagged ice.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
She unleashes a barrage of razor-sharp ice shards toward Squall. 

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Squall is struck by the icy barrage.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rinoa looks on in shock.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The camera cuts to a wide aerial view as the parade erupts into chaos, crowds scattering in panic.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The camera cuts back to Edea, her hand raised as she commands the ice.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Close-up of Edea, expression is cold, calm and composed.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Squall stands, an ice shard lodged in his chest, pain etched across his face.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Squall reels backward, falling from the platform.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Rinoa reaches for him, her face filled with sorrow, but he is too far away.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Close-up of Squall’s eyes slowly closing as the scene fades away.